@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title CFG reachability — scope, partition, and read-only evidence

rectangle "CodePropertyGraph\nAST + typed CFG overlay" as CPG #F1F3F5
rectangle "function AST scope\nstop before nested functions" as SCOPE #FFE8CC
rectangle "CFG universe U\nview nodes + scoped non-Call endpoints" as UNIVERSE #DBE4FF
rectangle "FunctionCfgView\nentry-reachable non-Call edges" as VIEW #D8F5A2
rectangle "iterative DFS\nvisited dense identifiers" as DFS #C3FAE8
rectangle "partition decision\n<latex>r \leadsto v</latex>?" as DECIDE #FFF3BF
rectangle "reachable R\nsorted NodeId vector" as REACHABLE #D3F9D8
rectangle "unreachable D\nsorted NodeId vector" as UNREACHABLE #FFC9C9
rectangle "conditional-edge scan\nguard · kind · target" as BRANCH_SCAN #FFE8CC
rectangle "DeadBranch records\ncanonical structural evidence" as DEAD #FFD8A8
rectangle "ReachabilityReport\nout-of-graph · deterministic" as REPORT #E5DBFF

rectangle "CfgExtractor block" as BUILDER #F1F3F5
rectangle "Return / Break / Continue / Throw\nor terminal wrapper/branch" as TERMINATOR #FFF3BF
rectangle "clear fallthrough exits\npreserve later AST siblings" as DISCONNECT #FFC9C9

CPG --> SCOPE
SCOPE --> UNIVERSE : induced CFG endpoints
SCOPE --> VIEW : constrain traversal
VIEW --> UNIVERSE : retain CFG-only fallback
UNIVERSE --> DECIDE
VIEW --> DFS
DFS --> DECIDE : visited set
DECIDE --> REACHABLE : yes
DECIDE --> UNREACHABLE : no
UNREACHABLE --> BRANCH_SCAN
CPG --> BRANCH_SCAN : typed conditional edges
BRANCH_SCAN --> DEAD
REACHABLE --> REPORT
UNREACHABLE --> REPORT
DEAD --> REPORT

BUILDER --> TERMINATOR : process child
TERMINATOR --> DISCONNECT : termination propagates
DISCONNECT ..> CPG : disconnected CFG island

note bottom of REPORT
  No node or edge is added, removed, or retyped.
  is_reachable uses the sorted reachable partition.
end note

note bottom of DECIDE
  <latex>R \cap D = \varnothing</latex>
  <latex>R \cup D = U</latex>
end note

legend right
  |= colour |= role |
  |<#F1F3F5>| source graph or builder |
  |<#FFE8CC>| AST scope / edge evidence scan |
  |<#DBE4FF>| complete CFG universe |
  |<#D8F5A2>| reachable function view |
  |<#C3FAE8>| iterative traversal |
  |<#FFF3BF>| reachability / termination decision |
  |<#D3F9D8>| reachable partition |
  |<#FFC9C9>| unreachable island |
  |<#FFD8A8>| structural dead-branch evidence |
  |<#E5DBFF>| public immutable report |
endlegend
@enduml
